    "searchText": "foxwell enforcement careercontract orange level contract: potential security threat foxwellenforcement_patrol_pyro_hard foxwell enforcement careercontract standing mercenary pickup: pyro several unknown ships have been spotted in areas frequented by haulers delivering goods for our client. they’re worried these ships are monitoring their haulers in preparation for an ambush, so they’ve hired us to patrol the area. \n\nstart by going to the location marker on your hud and scan it to ensure it’s clear. after that, we’ll send you to some other areas to scan for potential threats. we recommend that you bring a wingman and plenty of supplies to be ready to handle whatever might come your way.     \n\nalso know that successfully completing this contract will earn the main contractor a bonus payment of [scripamount] mg scrip.\n\ngood luck,\n\nkevin walton\ndispatcher, foxwell enforcement\n'security, your way'\n\nfoxwell enforcement is a bonded security specialist licensed to operate throughout the uee. we are always looking for new operators to join our family. if you or anyone you know is interested, please reach out to one of our contract representatives. orange level contract: security patrol red level contract: high-risk security patrol red level contract: secure threatened space yellow level contract: routine patrol yellow level contract: security sweep 62f48881-77c5-42ff-9acb-119d2a2db812 a2045b8a-2861-4530-923b-6237baa81c38 696ffb18-5211-4e4d-bb67-5e31eb562a9d 1c7c6b3b-424a-4909-8902-de4dc38e8a83 21f45002-9ea8-4dca-9553-d27eb85ceab9 f055aa9c-f9d9-4f93-82d1-e3a4a6b22f4e blueprint: foxwell enforcement patrol: parallax \"sanguine\" energy assault rifle, antium arms sand, antium core sand, antium legs sand +2 standing +200 credits formula unresolved item reward: mg scrip completion tag standing +150 standing +250 standing +300"
  },
